  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program cooperation agreement with UNESCO, cultural rights and freedom of speech</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program cooperation agreement, PCA, in the field of culture, communication and information.
World Heritage in Africa: 25 mill NOK, connected to UNESCO&apos;s 1972-convention (World Heritage-protection)
Heritage Emergency Fund, HEF, NOK 6 mill to activities under all 6 UNESCO culture conventions.
Ashberg Fund, support to artistic freedom, NOK 6 mill  connected to UNESCO&apos;s 2005-convension, protection and promotion of cultural diversity. NOK 10 million to the program under the program for communication &amp; information.
UNESCO has gender equality as on of their priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
